==============================================================================================================
   R = 2 R_d: s = +0.428, s_N = +0.230; a coherent slope error of +0.109 mimics the whole flat->rival gap (0.381 dex); MUTATE V x R^0.1 (ds = +0.2) moves a0 by +inf dex
   R = 3 R_d: s = +0.144, s_N = -0.237; a coherent slope error of +0.156 mimics the whole flat->rival gap (0.381 dex); MUTATE V x R^0.1 (ds = +0.2) moves a0 by +0.583 dex
